  (text "Memory map (bank:address), 512K parts\n  $00:0000-$00:BFFF  RAM (48K)\n  $00:C000-$00:CFFF  I/O (see Logic sheet)\n  $00:D000-$00:FFFF  flash $7D000-$7FFFF (12K boot window, vectors)\n  $01:0000-$07:FFFF  RAM\n  $08:0000-$0F:FFFF  flash (512K)\nA16-A18 come from the CPLD: BA0-BA2, or all ones in the bank 0 flash window.\nSmaller parts fit the same sockets.  128K SRAM (AS6C1008): pin 30 is CE2,\nso set RAM_SIZE to +5V (pins 2-3); banks $02-$07 then mirror $00-$01.\n512K SRAM: RAM_SIZE on A17 (pins 1-2).  SST39SF010/020: pins 1 and 30\nare NC/A17, nothing to change; the boot window is the top of the chip.\nRemove the FLASH_WRITE jumper to write-protect the flash." (at 25.4 160.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 63ed6c5d-dcd0-4a79-979f-7becd460524b)
  )
)
